operator: Howdy, Gardener.
operator: While you were exploring, I spotted a few of these vaults around the area.
operator: Thought I'd head to the one closest to you so we can chat after you've opened it up.
operator: We can look at whatever present they left you together!
operator: So don't let me keep ya.
operator: Oh, but real quick!
operator: Would you like to record any progress in your investigation?
- Yes
	operator: Saving progress...
	[signal arg="save_signal"]
	operator: Save complete.
	jump save_done
- No
	operator: Roger dodger! I'll be here if you need to save progress in the future.
	jump save_done
label save_done
operator: At that, I wish you the best of luck, Gardener.
operator: See you on the flip side!
[signal arg="scene_end_op"]
[end_timeline]